# But the order of matching:
# Try extents from LONGEST to SHORTEST:
# longest = node_extent for 'foo' which includes the () group = extent 3
# So it tries '$F = foo()' first, then tries '(' against eof -> fails
# Then tries shorter: '$F = foo', tries '(' against '(' -> succeeds!

