# But base_extent = 3 too (same)
# So it only tries extent=3: bind $F = 'foo()'
# Then tries '(' against eof -> FAIL
# Returns None!

# The bug: tried_extents only has ONE entry [3] because base_extent == full_extent
# I never try the intermediate extent=1 (just 'foo')!

